@HostAddress = http://localhost:5173
@token = TU_JWT_AQUI

### Health (sin auth)
GET {{HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Registro
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/add-user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ada",
  "lastname": "Lovelace",
  "age": 30,
  "email": "ada@x.com",
  "telephone": "999999999",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Login
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ada@x.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Listado paginado
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=20&sortBy=price&desc=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Stats
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/stats/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
